return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'rhg','project-id-version'=>'babilim-0.1.0-rhg-babilim-0.1.0-rhg-20261030T035456','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:40+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:40+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Babilim'=>'Babilim','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'Tuñar site-ot ageh install kora plugin ar theme-or nai thaka translation bhoridey.','Translations'=>'Torjoma','Babilim Settings'=>'Babilim Setting','Settings'=>'Setting','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Tuñare ito kôribar ijajot nai.','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Kom component basái loo: ek bar ot %1$d ta kaam fojjonto (tuñi %2$d ta basaisoo).','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Ito component ei site ot install kora nai, ehar lagi torjoma sháibo nôy.','Already installed.'=>'Aggoi install kora.','Downloaded and installed.'=>'Download oi install oi gel.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Babilim ei site ot ekkono chalu kora nai.','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Ito locale-or lagi download kôribar build nai.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Aggor build ot fisé gel.','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Fisé gel oi report dilo.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Fisé gel, kintu report fatabo nôy fare: %s','Removed.'=>'Mushi dilo.','Translation requested.'=>'Torjoma sái gel.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Ito component aggoi upload kora oise. Babilim ekhon ehar jasai kôrer.','Upload cancelled.'=>'Upload bad dilo.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Upload sesh — torjoma sái gel.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Ito component-or version number nai, ehar lagi torjoma sháibo nôy.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Ito component-or version number %d ta okkhor thaki boro, Babilim ehar sambhal kôribo nôy fare, ehar lagi torjoma sháibo nôy.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Ito locale-or lagi ei site ot ekhon torjoma sháibo nôy.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Shukria. Tuñar report fatai dilo.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Ito report ot thik plugin ba theme ar locale-or nam nai.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Dóya kôri ito report-or lagi ek category basái loo.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Ito report ot report kôribar lagi thik build nai.','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Ito build ei site ot ito component/locale-or lagi ekhon jana nai.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'"%1$s" field\'ot beshi lomba lekha oise: ehar %2$d ta okkhor ase, kintu sima %3$d. Kisu pathano nai. Doya kori choto kori abar cheshta koro.','Original string'=>'Asol string','String context'=>'String\'r context','Current translation'=>'Ekhonkar torjoma','Suggested translation'=>'Sujhab dowa torjoma','Note (optional)'=>'Note (iccha oile)','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Kot dekhsoo (iccha oile)','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'Babilim sync service\'tuni deri oiyé (rate limit); %s fôr aaro cesta kôribo.','The locale you added is not valid: use a WordPress locale code such as ll_CC (letters, digits, underscore, hyphen or @, at most %d characters). Nothing was saved.'=>'Tuñi zoga dewa locale thik nay: ll_CC nokhan WordPress locale code bebohar koro (okkhor, ongko, underscore, hyphen ba @, beshi oiley %d ta okkhor). Kisu save kora oy nai.','Settings saved.'=>'Setting save oi gel.','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Ito chalu thakile, uninstall kôribar logot ei site-or identity-o mushi dibo. Ei site ot lagi thaka paid license fisé aap-se-aap ferot sháibo nôy; ferot nibar lagi %s ot Babilim support-or lagot jogajog kôribo lagibo.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Plugin delete kôribar logot Babilim ei site-or identity mushi dibar lagi thik kora oise. Ei site ot lagi thaka paid license fisé aap-se-aap ferot sháibo nôy; %s ot Babilim support-or lagot jogajog kôribo lagibo. Identity rakibar lagi Cancel dabo, Babilim setting ot "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" tik uthai dao, aar aaro deactivate kôro. Tobu deactivate kôribo?','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Ei network-or %1$d ta site ot plugin delete kôribar logot Babilim identity mushi dibar lagi thik kora oise. Ei site-or lagi thaka paid license fisé aap-se-aap ferot sháibo nôy; %2$s ot Babilim support-or lagot jogajog kôribo lagibo. Identity rakibar lagi Cancel dabo, hóbbe site-or Babilim setting ot "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" tik uthai dao, aar aaro deactivate kôro. Tobu deactivate kôribo?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Ei network\'ot bohut site ase, ekkta ekkta kôri check kôra zay nai. Kunu kunu site\'ot plugin delete kôrile Babilim identity muchi zaibar setting thakibar pare. Oyman site\'or paid license pôre automatic ferot ana nozay; %s ot Babilim support\'or logot zogazog kôribo lagibo. Identity rakhibar lagi Cancel tipo, prottek site\'or Babilim settings\'ot "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" untick koro, aar abar deactivate koro. Tau deactivate kôribo?','Open Babilim settings'=>'Babilim settings khulo','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim ei site verify gorot fare nai, ejonno kunu kichu download ba install kora oibo na.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Service tuñar site-ot pouchi paré nai. Firewall, security plugin ba host rule request ṭa bondho goira thakibo pare; /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge-ot request allow goró.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Tuñar site jawab dité bessi shomoy loise. Pisé abar chesta goró, ar host bessi dhire ba bessi bhare ase nai dékho.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Tuñar site zawab dise, kintu asha kora zawab nó. Onno plugin\'e REST API bodlai dite paré, ba ei endpoint cache oiyé paré; /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge cache ar rewrite\'ot\'tuni bad dió.','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Dóya kori dékho tuñir site internet tóni paaowa jáy ni; tarpor ábar chesta goró.','Re-verify'=>'Abar verify koro','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Ei site service\'r ek sync\'ot newa sima\'r cheye boro, tai kisu item bad dewa oise: %1$d ta component ar %2$d ta locale.','This site is verified.'=>'Ei site verify hoise.','Registration restarted.'=>'Registration abar shuru oi gese.','Sync complete.'=>'Sync hói gelo.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim ei site chalu goirre ar check goirre… Ei page reload goro, nay schedule check sesh oiba tuk opekkha goro.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim chalu kôribo parot nai (%1$s): %2$s','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'Ekbar ot ekkna PHP request chalay ae host ei step sesh goirte nare.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim chalu oise: ei site verify oise ar %d ta component paowa gese.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim bondo oise. Aar kisu pathay nai; ageh install kora translation kam goribo.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Sweep ses hoiyse: %d file mushi dewa hoiyse.','Removed %d installed component.'=>'%d install oya component mushi fela oiyé.','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Otomatik install ekhún bond; laguile settings-ot ábar chalu goró.','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Babilim ei site\'ot tuñir zubanor torjoma nai oya plugin ar theme khuji bair kore, ar hérébé\'r lagi ekkan torjoma install kore.','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Ei site\'ot pawa zuban: %s.','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically (on the free plan, only for plugins and themes that already use a free slot).'=>'Thaka translation ek click\'ot install kora zay, ar nai thaka translation request kora zay. Eirpor notun translation ar update auto install oy (free plan\'ot, khali zeittu plugin ar theme age free slot bebohar kore heittu\'r lagi).','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Babilim chalu kôrile ki pathano oy','Enabling…'=>'Chalu goróir…','Enable Babilim'=>'Babilim chalu goro','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'Chalu goró-ot click goiley, uporot lekha khobor Babilim-ot pathanor lagi tuñi razi oiba.','Check again now'=>'Ekhún ábar jáasai goró','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'Tuyi sesh ayar pora Babilim %d translation nijje nijje install goirdi.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim ei site chalu kori ar check kori ase… (hesh cheshta: %s)','Check again'=>'Abar check koro','No components synced yet.'=>'Ekkhono kunu component sync oy nai.','%d succeeded'=>'%d ta safol hoise','%d skipped'=>'%d ta bad dewa oise','%d failed'=>'%d ṭa fail hoise','%d not yet tried'=>'%d ekhúno chesta nó-hóra','Bulk %s:'=>'Ekshaate %s:','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s kunu kam nai.','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s.','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s (%2$s): %3$s','Continuing…'=>'Chalu ase…','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'Pôrer batch cholao (%d baki)','Search components'=>'Component khuzo','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Eitu ei site\'ot bebohar oya zuban. Tuími %s-ot eitu bodlai paribó.','Upload this component?'=>'Ei component upload goribo?','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Confirm korar lagi kunu upload oyeit kori nai.','Back'=>'Fer zó','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Ei component translate gorar lagi Babilim ot ṭar source lagibo.','The entire plugin or theme directory of %1$s (version %2$s) will be uploaded to Babilim.'=>'%1$s (version %2$s)-r hoill plugin ba theme directory Babilim\'ot upload oibo.','If that directory contains keys, logs or customer data, they will be uploaded too. The service removes common sensitive files (configuration, environment, database dumps, logs, keys) but cannot guarantee it finds everything.'=>'Ei directory\'ot zodi key, log ba customer\'r data thake, heiyula\'o upload oibo. Service shadharon sensitive file (configuration, environment, database dump, log, key) soraiya dey, kintu shob file khuji paibo heitar guarantee nai.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Upload goirra jinish rakha oy, Babilim ke mucha-r lagi na koa porjonto.','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'Eita service-or hosting provider-e rakhe, ar AI model-e translation banaibar lagi kam kore.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Mul text ar ṭar thung banano translation, eigga version install goirra onno site ke dewa oibo.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'Agoibar logot tuyi manon ze ei component upload gorar odhikar tuyar ase.','Upload and request'=>'Upload kori request goró','Uploading…'=>'Upload goirre…','Cancel'=>'Batil kôro','Uploading'=>'Upload goirre','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Kunu upload cholát nai.','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'%2$d hissar bitore %1$d nombor hissa upload goirre…','Continue'=>'Zari rakho','Confirm'=>'Pakka goro','Remove'=>'Soraw','Roll back'=>'Fisot loi zao','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Confirm koribar kunu kam nai.','Choose a language'=>'Ekkhan zuban bachi loo','Roll back and report'=>'Fisot loi report goró','Report a problem'=>'Ekkhan somossa\'r khobor dew','Nothing to choose.'=>'Bachibar kunu kisu nai.','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s: %2$s. Bhasha basi loo.','Supplementary translations'=>'Ootirikto translation','Each component\'s own contribution to each locale\'s shared default-domain supplement.'=>'Shob locale\'r lagi shared default-domain supplement\'ot prottek component\'r nijor ongsho.','Component'=>'Component','Language'=>'Zuban','Included in index'=>'Index\'ot ase','Entries'=>'Entry','Conflicting keys'=>'Gondogol oya key','Yes'=>'Oy','No — component inactive'=>'Nay — component chalu nai','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Nó — install hórá version ar chalu version alada','No — component removed'=>'Na — component soraiya dewa oiyse','No'=>'Nó','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Khali network administrator ei kam korit paré, karon ei network\'r shob site\'r shared translation file bodlai.','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Babilim ei site\'or verification shesh kôribar parot nai (service site\'ot pouchibar parot nai). Registration thamano ase.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Ei site ot ekkhan cholti registration ase, kintu eitá aar nijei ferot ana zay na.','Restart registration'=>'Registration abar shuru koro','Babilim settings'=>'Babilim setting','General'=>'Jenaral','Languages'=>'Zuban','Automatic installs'=>'Automoték install','Install available translations automatically'=>'Pawa zaoya translation nijje nijje install goro','On the free plan, only components that already use one of your free slots are installed automatically, so no new slot is taken.'=>'Free plan\'ot, zeittu component tuñar free slot age bebohar kore, khali heittu auto install oy, tai notun slot lage