addle ror dara notun tab ot payment oy.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Ei kaam-ot notun restore code oibo, ar age-or code kaam nokorbo. Zari rakibo?','Show a new restore code'=>'Notun restore code dekhao','rc_…'=>'rc_…','Restore purchase'=>'Purchase restore koro','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Eibban restore code\'r moto dekhay na.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Ei site\'ót ei restore code chinhí nó pái.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Bout bar chesta goirrá. Kailla abar chesta goro.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Ei site age zasai goriba lagibo.','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'Purchase restore kori nó paré: %s','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Purchase fer paiyé. Ei site ekhón license\'ot ase.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Ei site ot code dekhanir lagi kunu kinon nai.','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'Notun ferot code dekhano zayna: %s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Tuñar notun restore code: %s. Nirapod zaigat rakkó — ager code ar kam nókoré.','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Babilim ei site check goróir shomoy ki pathay','(detected)'=>'(dhora poroise)','No language is managed yet.'=>'Ekhono kunu zuban manage kora oy nai.','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim ekhane tik dewa shob zubanor lagi translation zuré.','Add another language'=>'Aro ekkhan zuban zog goró','Choose a language…'=>'Ekkhan zuban bachi loo…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'Service\'tuni pura WordPress.org locale list load kora zayna, tai ekhon aar kunu zuban zoga dewa zayna.','Theme'=>'Theme','Plugin'=>'Plugin','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'Download: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)','Supplementary translation index'=>'Ootirikto torjoma index','Built'=>'Build kora oiyé','Included'=>'Shamil oiyé','Excluded'=>'Bad dewa oiyé','Already in WordPress core'=>'WordPress core\'ot age\'tuni ase','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Aro translation\'r dekhbhal','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'Ekhún maintenance-ór hálot dékhté nójay.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Sesh clean-up %1$s-ot: %2$d notun mark kora oiyé, %3$d file muchi dewa oiyé, %4$d record shoraiyé dewa oiyé.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the most recent version was kept.'=>'%1$s ot translation index (%2$s) lekha ekkhan dusra request\'r logé takkor khaiyé, tai lagano oy nai; sob\'tuni notun version rakha oiyé.','A translation-index write on %1$s (%2$s) could not be completed and was not applied (%3$s).'=>'%1$s ot translation index (%2$s) lekha shesh kora zay nai, tai lagano oy nai (%3$s).','Maintenance'=>'Dekhbhal','Rebuild index now'=>'Aijjoi index abar banao','Sweep now'=>'Ekhón soaf kor','Danger zone'=>'Khotor-r jaiga','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Eit site\'ót shob plugin ar theme\'r lagi Babilim zeto language file install koróyé, shob mushi fele.','This string is too long to be sent as a report, so no report form is offered for it.'=>'Ei string report goirra pathanir lagi bout lomba, ei lagi report form dewa nay.','Category'=>'Dhoron','Choose a category…'=>'Ekkhan category bachi lo…','Roll back and send report'=>'Fer rollback kor ar report fathó','Send report'=>'Report pathai dew','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Ei component\'r kiccu lekha ar lekhok nijé hard-code korise, tai language pack dia translate kora zayna.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Bundled with the theme'=>'Theme-ór logót ashé','Bundled with the plugin'=>'Plugin-ór logót ashé','Upload was not accepted'=>'Upload