 component.'=>'Bulk action khali prottek bachai kora component\'r bachai kora bhasha\'ot lage.','Version %s'=>'Version %s','Theme · %s'=>'Theme · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'Plugin · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'Ei site thaki %1$s ror %2$s translation soraibo nay?','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'%1$s component ror %2$s translation ager build ot fisot loi zaibo nay?','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Registration challenge thik form\'ot nai.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Eita thik build-or identifier nai.','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Babilim language-file directory\'r baire likhibar mana.','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'Download kora package disk\'ot lekhit nó paróng.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Asha na kora HTTP %d response.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'Ei site-ór URL, jeté service-e jánté páray tuñi eitár malik.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Tuñar WordPress version, mil thaka translation file dibar lagi.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Tuamar PHP version, compatibility\'r lagi.','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Eit plugin\'r nijor version, zeddé version boddo purána oile service\'e update korit koi dite paré.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Ei site\'or locale setting.','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(ei site\'r lagi banai dewa public key)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'Ei site-or install public key, request-bula ei site thaki asé eita proman goróir lagi bebohar hoy. Khali public ongsho pathay.','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'Shob install hórá plugin/theme: slug, version, text domain, wp.org listing ni, nijór bundled locale, ar kón locale-ór lagi Babilim translation install hórá.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'Khali WordPress.org\'ot nai emon plugin ba theme\'r upload tuñí confirm korile: oi component\'r hoill directory, zip hisabé.','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(khali generic code ar coordinate)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Sorbo bessi 20ṭa pending diagnostic event (zemon integrity check\'ot fail oya file), prottékṭa khali code, component ar locale; kunu string content ba translate kora lekha kokkhonó nó.','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Bipodjonok locale: %s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest pawa zay na: %s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Active component\'r hodis paoa zay nai; ager merged index bodol kora oy nai.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'Install kora plugin/theme zanot fare nai; sweep skip kora oise, kichu delete kora oy nai.','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Sweep kisu orphan na goira bondo oiyse: %s.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'\'%s\'r merged index abar banano oise, kintu translation index\'ot likhi rakhot fare nai; arekbar rebuild\'ot abar chesta goribo.','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'Stage hórá merged index likhté nójay.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Abar parse kora entry\'r gonti, banano index\'r logé mil nó khay.','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'\'%s\'-r merged index zaigat rakha gelo na. Age thaka index (zodi thake) adha-update obostha\'ot na rakhi muchi dewa oise. Porer rebuild shofol na oya porzonto ei locale\'r lagi kunu default-domain supplement dewa oibo na.','Could not open zip: %s'=>'Zip khulté nójay: %s','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip\'ot manifest.json nai.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'Zip\'ót thaka manifest.json shoyi JSON nó.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json\'ot thaka \'%s\' asha kora mulyor shoge mile na.','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'Aro ekkhan installation cholise. Kisukkhon pisé abar cheshta koro.','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Server_build_id thik nay: %s','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Package manifest ror kind \'%1$s\' ar chaoa kind \'%2$s\' mil khay nai.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Package-or text domain \'%1$s\' ei site-or component-or copy (\'%2$s\')-logot mil na khay, edar lagi install oi nai.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Dewa domain \'%1$s\' package manifest\'r nijor slug \'%2$s\' ba text_domain \'%3$s\' — kunuta\'r logé mil nó khay.','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Nirapod nó slug: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'Nirapod nó text_domain: %s','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Ei package ot nijor text domain ror lagi %s nai.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json\'ot \'%s\' nai ba bhul.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json\'ot \'entries\' nai ba zaigamoto nó.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json\'ot \'files\' nai ba zaigamoto nó.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json ot \'extra_domains\' nai, nay \'extra_domains\' ṭhik nòy.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json\'ot \'build_no\' nai ba thik nai.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json ror \'server_build_id\' thik build id nai.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json\'r \'contract\' thik version string nai.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json-or \'status\' \'published\' oiba lagibo.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json ror \'kind\' \'plugin\' nay \'theme\' oiba lagibo.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json\'ot \'default_domain_entries\' thik nai.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json ot \'default_domain_files\' thik nai.','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest\'ot \'%s\' nai ba zaigamoto nó.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest ror \'server_build_id\' thik build id nai.','No record for %s'=>'%s ror kunu record nai','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Ekkhan ba beshi serve kora file ar manifest\'r logé mil khay nai.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Rollback korar lagi age\'r kunu build nai.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Bodol translation index\'ot likha zay nai. Abar cheshta koro.','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Ojana type: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Niropod nay domain: %s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'Text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) age thaki onno ekkhan install kora component\'r (%3$s) lagi dewa ase. Kisu install kora oy nai.','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Rollback koriley \'%1$s\' (%2$s) overwrite oibo, zeita ekhon onno ekkhan install kora component\'r (%3$s) lagi dewa ase. Kisu bodol kora oy nai.','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip\'ot lagbar file nai: %s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'sha256 mil khay nai: %s','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Ei package-ot main translation file declare kora nai.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip ot asási file nai: %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s\'r sha256 mél khay nai','Could not stage %s'=>'%s stage kori pari nai','Could not stage default/%s'=>'default/%s stage hórté nójay','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s-or entry gonti mile nai','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'%s\'r entry\'r gonti yaqin kor\'ibar ne parilam','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s-or l10n.php entry-or gonti mile nai','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'Asási supplement\'r entry gonti mél khay nai.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Ei package ot dewar moto kunu main translation file bonay nai.','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'Rollback\'r lagi %s tayyar kora zayna.','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'Bodlanor ageh %s-or backup rakhi paré nai.','Could not move %s into place.'=>'%s thikmoto zayga\'ot soraiyé dewa zayna.','English (United States)'=>'English (United States)','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest nó pawa zay: %s','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json poron zay nai: %s','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json parse kora nafarilo: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json\'r structure thik nai','Could not create the package archive.'=>'Package archive banaibar nafarilo.','No writable temporary directory is available for packaging.'=>'Package korar lagi lekha jaibar moto temporary directory nai.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Component\'ar ek file poribar nafarilo, hay lagi package kora na gelo.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Khali plugin ar theme package kora jay.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Component-or main file paiye zay nai.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Component plugins naile themes directory\'ar bitore nai.','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim\'ar hoi step\'ar lagi somoy sesh hoi gelo, ar pore check\'ot age bare.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim hoi site verify korit nafarilo, hay lagi verification na hoile kunu kichu download naile install kora nay hoibo.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'Registration response\'ot dorkari field nai ashilo.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Verify korar lagi kunu pending challenge nai.','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Verify response\'ot site_token nai ashilo.','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Token rotate korar lagi kunu site id nai.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'Rotate-token response\'ot site_token nai ashilo.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce hexadecimal string hoibo lagbo.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Hoi nonce\'ar lagi kunu pending challenge nai.','Too many requests.'=>'Bei beshi request.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Hoi site\'ot %2$d bhasa\'ot %1$d component ashe, hoi\'ar lagi %3$d check batch lagbo; Babilim ek run\'ot sob\'toon beshi %4$d sambhal korit pare. Settings\'ot managed bhasa komaw naile na lagwa plugin ar theme deactivate korikoi, ekhon aber Check press koro.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim hoi site check sesh korit nafarilo.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Hoi site\'ar address bei lamba, Babilim register korit nafare.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Hoi site\'ar locale code Babilim register korit nafare.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Download response\'ot kaam\'ar location nai ashilo.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Service\'ar upload offer odhura ashilo.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Hoi component service\'ar limit\'toon boro, hay lagi upload kora na jay.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Package kora component poribar nafarilo.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'Upload ror ekkon ongso bar bar fail oiyé, ei lagi upload bondo goira dewa oilo.','Could not read: %s'=>'Poribar nafarilo: %s']];